90
00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:33.166
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

91
00:05:34.017 --> 00:05:36.295
blank by example, she inspired us.

92
00:05:36.595 --> 00:05:39.842
A, Leading. B, Lead. C, Led to.

93
00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.040
The answer is A: Leading.

94
00:05:46.183 --> 00:05:48.682
To give tasks to other people is to blank.

95
00:05:48.982 --> 00:05:52.833
A, delegate. B, inspire. C, reform.

96
00:05:56.367 --> 00:05:58.761
The answer is A: delegate.

97
00:05:59.917 --> 00:06:02.473
Leading by serving others is blank leadership.

98
00:06:02.773 --> 00:06:06.706
A, servant. B, visionary. C, strategic.

99
00:06:10.267 --> 00:06:12.464
The answer is A: servant.

100
